      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a sample formal letter you can use as a template:\n\nDear Hausverwaltung,\n\nI am writing to inform you of an issue with my apartment's heating system. My radiator in the living room has ceased functioning, resulting in an excessively cold temperature, which poses an uncomfortable living situation. I kindly request that this issue be addressed as soon as possible.\n\nI would appreciate a prompt response regarding the next steps and estimated timeline for resolving this matter. I expect a resolution to be achieved by the end of the week, and I look forward to hearing from you soon.\n\nSincerely,\n[Your Name]",
